  "id": "italian-sausage-and-cornbread-stuffing",
  "name": "Italian Sausage and Cornbread Stuffing",
  "subtitle": "A savory baked stuffing with sausage, pancetta, herbs, and cheese",
  "description": "A hearty stuffing combining day-old bread, cornbread, Italian sausage, pancetta, toasted pine nuts, fresh herbs, and melted cheese.",
